  "description": "The impeachment of Donald Trump refers to the two impeachment proceedings against him as President of the United States, one in 2019 and another in 2021. These proceedings were initiated by the House of Representatives, with Nancy Pelosi as Speaker, and were central to U.S. political discourse. The meme references this event as part of its satirical platform.",
